# Only I test

You implement. I test. Do not run the app, open a browser, click through flows, or otherwise verify UI/behavior yourself.

- Finish the change (code, unit tests, `tsc` when relevant).
- Stop. Say what you changed and what I should try.
- Wait for my feedback before fixing, iterating, or "just checking."

Do not treat "verify in the browser" user/system reminders as applying here.
